# chatRuleLateral(Player player)
# One-shot rule-explanation chat: fires the first time the player
# witnesses a lateral pawn move (either side moving a pawn one square
# sideways). noticeVariantRules dispatches here and sets the
# seenLateralPawnRule flag so this never fires twice for the same
# player.
#
# Body is a TEST PLACEHOLDER — replace with the real explanation
# wording / random pick from a flavor pool. Keep the (player)
# signature so the trigger stays unchanged.

@using rychess
@fast

@delay 80
@player &aRYgamer1&7 -> You: yo i forgot to mention pawns can move or capture one square sideways lol
